    "title": "What day is Easter 2025? Florida stores closed for holiday",
    "text": "NEWSWhat is 'Easter blackout?' Florida stores open, closed on Easter Sunday Ashley FerrerUSA TODAY NETWORK - FloridaApril 8, 2025, 12:29 p.m. ETEaster Sunday is just a few hops around the corner.A bit later than usual, the important Christian holiday falls on Sunday, April 20 this year. The holiday will come far sooner next year, falling on Sunday, April 5.Whether or not you celebrate, the date 4/20 might be of note as the unofficial holiday for cannabis users or because various retailers are closing for the day in what some are calling an 'Easter blackout.'",
